{"overview":"کانگ جی‑وون، بیمار سرنوشت‌مرد سرطان، پس از دیدن خیانت همسر و بهترین دوستش، توسط آن‌ها کشته می‌شود. او ده سال قبل از حادثه بیدار می‌شود و تصمیم می‌گیرد با کمک یو جی‑هیُک، کارگردان شرکت محل کارش، انتقام بگیرد. اکنون او باید سرنوشت خود را بازپس‌گیرد و زباله‌های زندگی‌اش را از بین ببرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kang Ji-won, a terminally ill cancer patient, is killed by her husband and best friend after she witnesses them having an affair. She wakes up 10 years before the incident and decides to seek revenge with the help of Yu Ji-hyuk, a director at the company where she works. Now, she must reclaim her fate and eliminate the trash from her life.","tagline_en":"A drama about creating a new destiny.","runtime":63,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":16,"y":2024,"poster":"/zaqWOgvOK4yoUuklvO4uySXi19o.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["박원국","신유담"],"crew_en":["Park Won-gook","Shin Yoo-dam"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"박민영","role":"Kang Ji-won","photo":"/5Op0Gx0DULFLHtGdWVdqnYdwkAS.jpg","en":"Park Min-young"},{"name":"나인우","role":"Yoo Ji-hyeok","photo":"/A0ibLEz3mwzUljcIzLoadxhcDOd.jpg","en":"Na In-woo"},{"name":"이이경","role":"Park Min-hwan","photo":"/arIQjEhzxihRJvkOJjIksPA5EZM.jpg","en":"Lee Yi-kyung"},{"name":"송하윤","role":"Jeong Su-min","photo":"/pPn8m1cjEtMoSdC3w50TbaMl6h9.jpg","en":"Song Ha-yoon"},{"name":"이기광","role":"Baek Eun-ho","photo":"/4krpBmuM6wlPqct4FIiLLF1ZjvQ.jpg","en":"Lee Gi-kwang"},{"name":"공민정","role":"Yang Joo-ran","photo":"/wkUiwCHq2Z2h4A7JDlhjrVGQiCk.jpg","en":"Gong Min-jeung"},{"name":"보아","role":"Oh Yu-ra","photo":"/fZmjUsnLS9QETQrnUkObmX0GKhQ.jpg","en":"BoA"},{"name":"최규리","role":"Yoo Hee-yeon","photo":"/a8rHzs04QqTBGG0Q2BTnPPULpFc.jpg","en":"Choi Gyu-ri"},{"name":"김중희","role":"Kim Kyung-wook","photo":"/dAx8wsECyBXcorIZHJdHnnfZBE8.jpg","en":"Kim Joong-hee"},{"name":"하도권","role":"Lee Suk-joon","photo":"/lOiNEmbHhMkX8mICJfu9R1kzC36.jpg","en":"Ha Do-kwon"},{"name":"문성근","role":"Yoo Han-il","photo":"/wQjOvAFqCItwMw7dx